          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nke a bụ ihe Onyenwe anyị sịrị m, \"Tupu otu afọ agwụ, dị ka esi agụ afọ onye ohu e goro ọrụ, ịma mma Keda ga-agwụsị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị fọdụrụ ndụ nʼime ndị na-agba ụta, ndị bụ dike nʼagha na Keda, ga-adị mmadụ ole na ole.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", bụ Chineke Izrel ekwuola ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
